1
00:00:00,393 --> 00:00:01,453
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)Don't bother.

2
00:00:01,628 --> 00:00:06,118
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)I'll just go sit in a hole in the ground
so I'm no trouble when I die.

3
00:00:07,701 --> 00:00:09,291
(Howard:)Stop it, Ma.

4
00:00:09,469 --> 00:00:12,699
(Howard:)I'm sure I can get Bernie to come around.

5
00:00:12,873 --> 00:00:16,333
I knew it! I knew she was behind this.

6
00:00:16,510 --> 00:00:21,970
You listen to me, if you wanna be a man
you can't let a woman tell you what to do.

7
00:00:23,750 --> 00:00:25,510
(Howard:)Okay, okay.

8
00:00:25,685 --> 00:00:29,555
(Dimitri:)I can't believe these people
won the Cold War.

9
00:00:31,658 --> 00:00:34,488
(Howard:)Now, can we please change the subject?

10
00:00:34,661 --> 00:00:39,531
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)Fine. Explain why you've been gone so long
and I haven't gotten a single letter.

11
00:00:39,699 --> 00:00:42,499
Not even a lousy postcard!

12
00:00:47,908 --> 00:00:50,708
(Leonard:)You know,
I'm growing to like American football.

13
00:00:50,877 --> 00:00:52,777
- Yeah, it's fun, isn't it?
- Well...

14
00:00:52,946 --> 00:00:57,716
(Raj:)...it's not the balls-to-the-wall action
of badminton or cricket, but hey...

15
00:00:58,285 --> 00:01:01,025
(Raj:)...what is?

